            {
                "entry_id": "a590bedc-1f72-3a05-a5d1-f6db49682c5a",
                "word": "же",
                "pos": "particle",
                "lang_code": "ru",
                "forms": [],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "16bcd259-b39e-3a4d-9f00-2cf3cb99d7c3",
                        "entry_id": "a590bedc-1f72-3a05-a5d1-f6db49682c5a",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Emphasises identity: very, same"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "406a7bfa-d730-4493-9bdc-3afb9637020e",
                                "sense_id": "16bcd259-b39e-3a4d-9f00-2cf3cb99d7c3",
                                "text": "тако́й же (са́мый)",
                                "translation": "the same, similar",
                                "english": "the same, similar"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "ae61908b-54d6-422c-aae4-836101c18c55",
                                "sense_id": "16bcd259-b39e-3a4d-9f00-2cf3cb99d7c3",
                                "text": "Я купи́л таку́ю же кни́гу.",
                                "translation": "I bought the same book.",
                                "english": "I bought the same book."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "2f9c703b-c3fe-4da2-98b3-1c45573240ff",
                                "sense_id": "16bcd259-b39e-3a4d-9f00-2cf3cb99d7c3",
                                "text": "тот же (са́мый)",
                                "translation": "the same, identical",
                                "english": "the same, identical"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "4042426f-63c7-4764-8c59-28032a5d8a7a",
                                "sense_id": "16bcd259-b39e-3a4d-9f00-2cf3cb99d7c3",
                                "text": "Он всё тот же!",
                                "translation": "He's always the same!",
                                "english": "He's always the same!"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "5623d01b-f9b5-42fb-8d8c-93169f71df18",
                                "sense_id": "16bcd259-b39e-3a4d-9f00-2cf3cb99d7c3",
                                "text": "Э́то то́ же са́мое.",
                                "translation": "It's the same thing.",
                                "english": "It's the same thing."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "ac5aa8bb-2afe-34fd-9186-bb27bdaecb12",
                        "entry_id": "a590bedc-1f72-3a05-a5d1-f6db49682c5a",
                        "glosses": [
                            "With expressions of time and order: emphasises promptitude: very, right, immediately, without delay"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "42e40693-1fce-4168-9f44-7be2ce6ea4a1",
                                "sense_id": "ac5aa8bb-2afe-34fd-9186-bb27bdaecb12",
                                "text": "На пе́рвой же страни́це была́ оши́бка.",
                                "translation": "Right on the first page there was a mistake.",
                                "english": "Right on the first page there was a mistake."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "04700585-6b25-43ff-bea7-8ce12d0218e2",
                                "sense_id": "ac5aa8bb-2afe-34fd-9186-bb27bdaecb12",
                                "text": "На сле́дующий же день рабо́та была́ гото́ва.",
                                "translation": "The very next day the work was finished.",
                                "english": "The very next day the work was finished."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "c340fbb8-eb60-4afa-a68b-f0ae2709662c",
                                "sense_id": "ac5aa8bb-2afe-34fd-9186-bb27bdaecb12",
                                "text": "Прекрати́те сейча́с же!",
                                "translation": "Stop immediately!",
                                "english": "Stop immediately!"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "e7602260-a175-481e-a8fc-01381a4cbd81",
                                "sense_id": "ac5aa8bb-2afe-34fd-9186-bb27bdaecb12",
                                "text": "После у́жина она́ сра́зу же легла́ спать.",
                                "translation": "After dinner she went straight to bed.",
                                "english": "After dinner she went straight to bed."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "2c526e74-d786-3c55-8d10-5c575db735d8",
                        "entry_id": "a590bedc-1f72-3a05-a5d1-f6db49682c5a",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Marks an objection by pointing to the rationale behind said objection: after all, but"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "c4361bf9-a483-422b-a627-3fff10829150",
                                "sense_id": "2c526e74-d786-3c55-8d10-5c575db735d8",
                                "text": "Почему́ вы не понима́ете? Это же ру́сский!",
                                "translation": "Why don't you understand? After all, it’s Russian!",
                                "english": "Why don't you understand? After all, it’s Russian!"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "81b4cd0a-de22-4719-a052-591626839d43",
                                "sense_id": "2c526e74-d786-3c55-8d10-5c575db735d8",
                                "text": "-Я не знал, что за́втра экза́мен. -Я же тебе́ сказа́л!",
                                "translation": "-I didn't know the exam was tomorrow. -But I told you!",
                                "english": "-I didn't know the exam was tomorrow. -But I told you!"
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "1cbd38fa-80d5-3e13-b2ad-57f19abd683a",
                        "entry_id": "a590bedc-1f72-3a05-a5d1-f6db49682c5a",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Especially in questions: expresses consequence of or reaction to what was said before: then, so"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "b540ee5a-fc17-42ef-9887-ac5f3d2c6872",
                                "sense_id": "1cbd38fa-80d5-3e13-b2ad-57f19abd683a",
                                "text": "Что ж!",
                                "translation": "Well then!",
                                "english": "Well then!"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "bef252f1-fdaf-4a39-adbc-2d495cbc3f00",
                                "sense_id": "1cbd38fa-80d5-3e13-b2ad-57f19abd683a",
                                "text": "Когда́ же?",
                                "translation": "When then?",
                                "english": "When then?"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "04258454-0e44-4839-9f8c-c1ae76f0e206",
                                "sense_id": "1cbd38fa-80d5-3e13-b2ad-57f19abd683a",
                                "text": "Где же э́то?",
                                "translation": "Where is it then?",
                                "english": "Where is it then?"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "57b9fb68-2ee9-4d90-b8fb-581f9370ba38",
                                "sense_id": "1cbd38fa-80d5-3e13-b2ad-57f19abd683a",
                                "text": "Что ж?",
                                "translation": "What then?",
                                "english": "What then?"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "457fd9d2-505e-42e4-99d0-6f71a5663a31",
                                "sense_id": "1cbd38fa-80d5-3e13-b2ad-57f19abd683a",
                                "text": "Ну что же?",
                                "translation": "What of it, then?",
                                "english": "What of it, then?"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "732ab828-9b96-4782-bf65-8d5bab398b83",
                                "sense_id": "1cbd38fa-80d5-3e13-b2ad-57f19abd683a",
                                "text": "Ну и что ж?",
                                "translation": "Well, what of it? / So what?",
                                "english": "Well, what of it? / So what?"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "f4b2f07f-77e6-4e81-ac8b-65d98972342c",
                                "sense_id": "1cbd38fa-80d5-3e13-b2ad-57f19abd683a",
                                "text": "Что ж из э́того?",
                                "translation": "So what of it?",
                                "english": "So what of it?"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "3efdea5b-a048-46a9-876d-413c45644200",
                                "sense_id": "1cbd38fa-80d5-3e13-b2ad-57f19abd683a",
                                "text": "Что ж, он сам э́то сде́лает!",
                                "translation": "Why, he'll just do it himself!",
                                "english": "Why, he'll just do it himself!"
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "b5555959-ae07-3ccb-865a-ae21eca78d52",
                        "entry_id": "a590bedc-1f72-3a05-a5d1-f6db49682c5a",
                        "glosses": [
                            "In questions and imperatives: imparts a note of insistence and urgency: ever, on earth, for goodness' sake"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "bde2e229-217e-4b88-9213-d61aa7406fcd",
                                "sense_id": "b5555959-ae07-3ccb-865a-ae21eca78d52",
                                "text": "Что же ему́ де́лать?",
                                "translation": "What on earth can he do?",
                                "english": "What on earth can he do?"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "0b96f814-a929-47db-b3bd-d02a04c1e4cb",
                                "sense_id": "b5555959-ae07-3ccb-865a-ae21eca78d52",
                                "text": "Говори́те же!",
                                "translation": "Aren’t you going to say anything!",
                                "english": "Aren’t you going to say anything!"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "4878725c-7b00-4a22-bbd8-89b93307e8b0",
                                "sense_id": "b5555959-ae07-3ccb-865a-ae21eca78d52",
                                "text": "Отвеча́йте же!",
                                "translation": "Answer me then!",
                                "english": "Answer me then!"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "bda18646-373d-419c-8c7c-7f9513570237",
                                "sense_id": "b5555959-ae07-3ccb-865a-ae21eca78d52",
                                "text": "Пойдём же!",
                                "translation": "So come along!",
                                "english": "So come along!"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [],
                "word_linkages": []
            }
        ],
